{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-02_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-02","title":"雨中漫步","storyCode":"4-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"4e757de4a2ce7d6253b5a2d79c0ffcf5b800aa0830dc5d3b6d78201d451c911d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱，抱歉，我不是有意撞過來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事的。你很有禮貌呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦，姐姐你在這裡做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡還在下雨呢，為什麼不躲一躲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......嗯......我只是......出來走走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在找人幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！姐姐是怎麼知道的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不能告訴你！這可是姐姐的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔......不管了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，能不能請你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好像......不太行。姐姐，你的個子，太小了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可不能這麼說別人！你明明比我矮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那，那我們試試吧......嗯......能不能幫我抬一下那塊板子？一起來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個鐵架下面，有台留聲機，我想拿回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"1......2......3！嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"成功了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，姐姐力氣還蠻大的呢！謝謝姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......這個留聲機......還是壞了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係！因為它最開始就是壞的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總有一天可以修好的。我給大家收集了不少唱片，雖然從來都沒聽過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————但總有一天，我會放給大家聽的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......如此輕鬆的說著這些艱難的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我到底是為了什麼......又能做什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐不怕我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......怕什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可是感染者哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......我也是呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼！太可惜了，姐姐長得這麼可愛，居然是感染者......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者不是什麼問題。無論是健康人還是感染者——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果是個好孩子，就一直是個好孩子哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉——？我聽不懂呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（咕嚕......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......餓了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......給你，我只帶了這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！謝謝你，兔姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過你.....為什麼來這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我答應過一個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐再見！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，再見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就連那樣的孩子，最後，最後也只會......"},{"type":"narration","text":"被剝奪了身份的人。感染者。你們早已不是人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我能做什麼呢，我又能，再多做些什麼呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......我不能保護大家呢......"},{"type":"narration","text":"你不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我......"},{"type":"narration","text":"饑荒......迫害......死亡......\n感染者終究只有這樣的結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不是這樣的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只要羅德島還在為了感染者....."},{"type":"narration","text":"你只是少數幸運兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不，所有人都聚在一起，向著共同的目標，不斷地努力。"},{"type":"narration","text":"這片大地已經麻木。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者絕不能就此陷入絕望......"},{"type":"narration","text":"你。\n被憤怒吞噬吧。\n只有———————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我不會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我答應過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我答應過她——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......?"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_31_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一個姐姐和我說過，這個布偶，只有親手做的才有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所以所以，這個送給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"另一個少女的聲音","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——————。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那個聲音是 ......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那個背影————"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_31_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是陳小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——————。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"————————————。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——————————————————————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"另一個少女的聲音","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——————。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_3